                <pb facs="0007" n="III" xml:id="pgIII"/>

                <head>Contents</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">(<hi rendition="#small-caps">Note</hi>: For previously
                    published correspondence on relations between the United States and Japan in
                    1937, see <ref target="frus:frus1931-41v01"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, Volumes I</ref> and <ref
                        target="frus:frus1931-41v02">II</ref>. Documents printed in those volumes
                    have not been reprinted in the 1937 annual volumes.)</p>
                <list type="toc">
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Undeclared War Between Japan and China</hi>: <list>
                            <item>Political and military developments: <list>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg1">Chapter I: January 1–July 7,
                                        1937</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg128">Chapter II: July 8–25,
                                        1937</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg261">Chapter III: July 26–August 13,
                                            1937</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg404">Chapter IV: August 13–31,
                                        1937</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg501">Chapter V: September 1–October 11,
                                            1937</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg596">Chapter VI: October 12–November 22,
                                            1937</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg711">Chapter VII: November 23–December 12,
                                            1937</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg798">Chapter VIII: December 13–31,
                                            1937</ref></item>
                                </list></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg848">Representations to the Japanese Government
                                    with respect to the integrity of the Chinese Maritime Customs
                                    and Salt Revenue Administrations</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg915">Developments with respect to “Manchoukuo”;
                                    reservation by the United States of American rights threatened
                                    by consolidation of Japanese Army control</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg954">Consideration of neutralization of islands of
                                    the Pacific Ocean or a general Pacific pact of
                                    nonaggression</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><ref target="#pg995"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Index</hi></ref></item>
                </list>
